    "created_at": "2020-09-08T17:42:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-08T17:42:44Z",
    "body": "FWIW I would prefer to always remove, in both APIs. It would be nice if the URL data model could guarantee no trailing C0 control or space instead of having the trimming being a parsing quirk.",
